<title>ITALY: Italy govt approves transfer of telecom concession.</title>
<headline>Italy govt approves transfer of telecom concession.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian government on Wednesday approved a decree transferring the telecommunications concession to state holding group Stet from Telecom Italia, a statement said after a cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>Stet is due to be merged with its main operating unit Telecom Italia later this year ahead of the planned privatisation of the enlarged entity.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
